review_text:
3.5 stars; 
 I forgot how much a enjoyed this series! Eibhear & Izzy were a long time coming. A compliment and a compliment is that like fantasy novels, there's a lot of characters and storylines so you're never bored but as a romance novel, all I want is Eibhear and Izzy please. Focus on the coupleeeeeeeeee ): But the adventure was fun. 
 (note: I have actually read the entire series as to date, despite not rating all the books on goodreads, it's because the ones I didn't rate were the books where I may or maynot have kinda skimmed through stuff and not entirely fully read it...sometimes it happens, maybe I'll go back to them sometime haha)
